text = "rescued from her /cyber space~  \nprison thanks to sonic,amy    \ncanon is back with much more  \nexp,far stronger than before: \nshe's now stronger than her   \nversion of this dimension.    \nher /tarot~ power and her       \nbetter use of the /hammer      \nparry~ let her fight on equal  \nground against the assassins. \n                              \n`p.s.:she can fight on equal   \nground against the exes~       ";
